                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today I toured Franklin Hospital, one of nine rural Illinois hospitals at risk of closure due to cruel Medicaid cuts in the Republican \u201cLarge Lousy Law.\u201d This isn\u2019t just a budget issue. It\u2019s about whether families here can deliver babies, treat cancer, or survive an emergency. https://t.co/5E0ehpzlQP",
