                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Sixty years ago, America made a promise that seniors, low-income families, and people with disabilities would have access to health care through Medicare and Medicaid.\n\nNow, Republican cuts threaten to break that promise. I\u2019m ready to fight back. https://t.co/GN1Y1kDp3x",
