                "retweet_count": 6,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Medicare and Medicaid are lifelines for millions of Americans. But the Trump budget turns its back on them, with $1.5 trillion in cuts that would leave seniors, children, and people with disabilities to fend for themselves. We didn\u2019t build this system to watch it be destroyed. https://t.co/7NfZlYk4m7",
