                "retweet_count": 14,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I joined community members in Palatine for Rise. Resist. Rally., one of 400+ events nationwide pushing back against the Trump administration\u2019s assault on seniors and working families. We stood together to defend Medicaid, food assistance, and the rest of our social safety net. https://t.co/rtyY5kYvwe",
