                "text": "Trump called himself the \u201cfather of IVF\u201d on the campaign trail, but six months in, there\u2019s no plan to expand access, no mandate for insurers, and deep Medicaid cuts that make fertility care even less affordable. Empty promises don\u2019t help families grow.\nhttps://t.co/8kEJIO70tW",
